# BCPS Lab 6 - Spreadsheet

## Aim
To create and format a spreadsheet using LibreOffice Calc.

## Software Used
LibreOffice Calc

## Procedure
1. Opened LibreOffice Calc.
2. Created a spreadsheet.
3. Entered data into rows and columns.
4. Applied cell formatting.
5. Used formulas and basic functions to perform calculations.
6. Adjusted column widths and row heights.
7. Saved the spreadsheet.

## Result
Learned how to create, format, and manage spreadsheet data using LibreOffice Calc
